<p>The <b>2024 Libertarian National Convention</b>, the biannual <a href="/wiki/Libertarian_Party#National_Conventions" title="Libertarian Party">Libertarian Party</a> National Convention, was held in the Washington Hilton, Washington, DC, from May 24, 2024 through May 26, 2024.  The theme was "Become UnGovernable." The Libertarian National Convention was also held in Washington D.C. in 1976, 1996, and 1998 making this the fourth National Convention to happen in the District of Columbia.
</p>
