<h2><span class="mw-headline" id="Presidential_candidates">Presidential candidates</span></h2>
<p><i>Main article: <b><a href="/wiki/Presidential_Candidates_2024" title="Presidential Candidates 2024">Presidential Candidates 2024</a></b> </i>
</p><p><a href="/wiki/Chase_Oliver" title="Chase Oliver">Chase Oliver</a> won the nomination.
</p>
<h2><span class="mw-headline" id="Speakers">Speakers</span></h2>
<ul><li>Dr. Peter McCullough</li>
<li>Gabriel Shipton</li>
<li>Dr. Mark Skousen</li>
<li>Robert Breedlove</li>
<li><a href="/wiki/Spike_Cohen" title="Spike Cohen">Spike Cohen</a></li>
<li><a href="/wiki/Dave_Smith" title="Dave Smith">Dave Smith</a></li>
<li>Vivek Ramaswamy</li>
<li>Former President of the United States  <a target="_blank" rel="nofollow noreferrer noopener" class="external text" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Donald_Trump">Donald John Trump</a></li>
<li>Robert Francis Kennedy Jr</li>
<li><a href="/wiki/Ron_Paul" title="Ron Paul">Ron Paul</a></li></ul>
