<h2><span class="mw-headline" id="Convention_Memorial">Convention Memorial</span></h2>
<p>The <a href="/wiki/Libertarian_Party_Historical_Preservation_Committee" class="mw-redirect" title="Libertarian Party Historical Preservation Committee">Libertarian Party Historical Preservation Committee</a> authorized a subordinate committee to prepare a memorial presentation for Libertarians who passed away in the past few years.
</p>
